[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0010","text":"路加，超适合你的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0020","text":"平时那种酷酷的感觉也很好，但这次这种可爱的氛围我觉得也很适合你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0030","text":"吵死了……\n被你说这种话我反胃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0040","text":"不是，可是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0050","text":"你就不能闭嘴吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0060","text":"辛苦了！\n哇，路加酱，超可爱的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0070","text":"嗯……！\n非常，适合你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0080","text":"──────……\n一个个的都……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0090","text":"斑鸠小姐辛苦了！哇！\n超级适合，好可爱啊～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_03_0100","text":"…………"}]
